   "edited": false,
   "license": "CC BY-SA 2.5",
   "body_html": "As it was an interview question, I don&#39;t think they expected yes/no answer. You were expected to explain what malloc/free and new/delete do, how they differ, how they are used and <b>why</b> you should not mix them. This will show them that you know how C++ and C++ runtime works, how it relates to C standard library and that you can think about those issues. So, answering your question, with &quot;answer [...] there is no difference&quot; you failed. :-("
